Applications for Outreachy open source internships are now open.
Outreachy is a 12-week paid internship aimed at increasing
participation of underrepresented groups in open source.  It was
started as a reaction to the low number of women in open source.
https://www.gnome.org/outreachy/

QEMU project ideas are listed here:
http://wiki.qemu-project.org/Outreachy_2017_MayAugust

If you know someone who could be interested, please spread the word!

The deadline for internship applications is March 30, 2017.

